## Program Outcome

Tool Shed's retained capability surface, ownership layers, and reduction rules are explicit, and
one authority-aware project projection supplies both executive state and exhaustive lifecycle
inventory. The dashboard consumes that seam without wire drift or duplicate state construction;
the exact Work2 candidate passes protected-invariant, Linux, and Windows development proof; and the
later 100k feature has one required input contract and a documented replacement boundary.

